### ==============================================================================
### FILE & DOCUMENT UPLOADS APIS (Uploaded to backend/uploads/)
### ==============================================================================

@baseUrl = http://localhost:5000/api

### 1. Upload Single File (Payment Screenshot / ID Proof / Audit PDF / Seal / Photo)
POST {{baseUrl}}/upload
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=WebAppBoundary

--WebAppBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="sample_payment_receipt.jpg"
Content-Type: image/jpeg

< ./sample_payment_receipt.jpg
--WebAppBoundary--

### 2. Upload Multiple Files
POST {{baseUrl}}/upload/multiple
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=WebAppBoundary

--WebAppBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="files"; filename="document1.pdf"
Content-Type: application/pdf

< ./document1.pdf
--WebAppBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="files"; filename="document2.jpg"
Content-Type: image/jpeg

< ./document2.jpg
--WebAppBoundary--
